# Generated Prisma clients — regenerated by `prisma generate`, never hand-formatted.
# Without this, `pnpm format` rewrites ~29k lines that the next generate reverts.
apps/*/src/lib/db/generated
# The Express API keeps its client at src/db/generated — no `lib` segment.
apps/*/src/db/generated

# Lockfile — pnpm owns this format and rewrites it on every install. Without
# this, the `pnpm format` that git.md requires before committing produces an
# ~11k-line diff that the next `pnpm install` undoes, and that can drop
# platform-specific resolutions on the way through.
pnpm-lock.yaml
